  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you have trackers set to freeze on disconnect it will be hard to swap over to 3p tracking if one of them have disconnected due to low battery or something. You will just be stuck with one tracker frozen in space.\n\n1. With full body calibrated. Enable \"Freeze tracking on disconnect\".\n\n2. Turn off one or more of your trackers. They should now be frozen in place.\n\n3. In quick menu settings. Disable \"Allow FullBody Tracking FBT\"\n\n4. move around a bit. Your tracking points are now still frozen in space. And you're not in 3p tracking giving you the sit/stand button in the menu.\n\nI would expect that you get back into 3p tracking if you turn off allow FBT in the menu.",
